Source: tribalism
Section: games
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Tribalism <gleethros@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2

Package: tribalism
Architecture: amd64
# Runtime dependencies.
#  - default-jre: the application is a JVM app.
#  - uidmap: provides the setuid-root newuidmap/newgidmap helpers REQUIRED for the AI agent's
#    rootless podman sandbox (we ship podman+crun+conmon ourselves, but these two helpers MUST come
#    from the OS — they cannot be bundled, being setuid-root). See packaging/README.md and the
#    app.agent.sandbox.PodmanSandboxRuntime class documentation.
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         default-jre (>= 2:1.21),
         uidmap
# fuse-overlayfs, slirp4netns, crun, conmon, podman, git are all bundled by the app — do NOT add them.
Description: Tribalism — the AI-assisted pen & paper game master
 A desktop tool for pen & paper game masters with a 3D voxel map engine, live multiplayer
 sessions over the LAN, and a sandboxed agentic AI game master that runs in its own rootless
 podman container.
